From 92d0f078a0ffa3799a35dc8eaa1087a231726ad7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "nipuna.dulara" <pererannd.21@uom.lk>
Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 12:56:33 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/9] nr: Scaffold the PHY-to-energy-model listener bridge

Add the callback bridge between NR PHY events and the energy models:
NrPhyEnergyListener starts as a combined gNB/UE scaffold wired for the
sf/sp/sa hooks, backed by minimal stub NrGnbEnergyModel/NrUeEnergyModel
classes, then gets split into a separate NrGnbPhyEnergyListener and
NrUePhyEnergyListener (dropping the scheduler/MAC coupling the combined
version needed), which is the shape the framework keeps from here on.
